        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia AP-1968P, Elite Collection Milano Appliance Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Milano Appliance Pull has a retro modern look that is sleek and sophisticated. This Refrigerator Pull comes packaged with the mounting hardware to install it on a standard appliance panel. It is sturdy enough to be used on vacuum sealed fridges such as Sub-Zero. The Elite Collection Milano Appliance Handle is available in 12 inch and 18 inch center to center lengths. Choose from a wide array of contemporary finish colors. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Omnia AP-1968P pull is available as a <a href=\"/products/milano-cabinet-pull-omnia-1968\"><b>Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Milano Refrigerator Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Pull Mounting: Standard 3/4\" Thick Appliance Panel</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n\r\n<b>AP-1968P/305:</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length (center to center): 12\"  (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 12-15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 19/32\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<b>AP-1968P/457:</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length (center to center): 18\"  (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 18-15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 19/32\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
