                "description": "The Milano Appliance Pull has a retro modern look that is sleek and sophisticated. This Refrigerator Pull comes packaged with the mounting hardware to install it on a standard appliance panel. It is sturdy enough to be used on vacuum sealed fridges such as Sub-Zero. The Elite Collection Milano Appliance Handle is available in 12 inch and 18 inch center to center lengths. Choose from a wide array of contemporary finish colors.",
